  <!-- ============= Online Help  ============-->

  <title>Online Help</title>

  <section id="xiphos-mailing-list">

    <title>Project Support</title>

    <p>For help with <app>Biblia Elim</app>, report a problem or ask a question
    on the <link href="https://github.com/OmarGonD/biblia-elim/issues">project
    issue tracker</link>.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="xiphos-live-chat">

    <title>Report a problem</title>

    <p>Include the Biblia Elim version and the steps needed to reproduce the
    problem when filing a report. This helps the project maintainers diagnose
    it.</p>

  </section>

